      "id": "3f88bfed-9a6a-4de5-aada-2a25091e9daf",
      "name": "Loop über Videos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1760,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "anthropic-version",
              "value": "2023-06-01"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: $('Konfiguration').first().json.ki_modell, max_tokens: 32000, system: $('Konfiguration').first().json.prompt, messages: [{ role: 'user', content: $json.transcript_text }] }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 600000
        }
      },
      "id": "f70fe8fa-2060-4671-8495-2245e2ec0d86",
      "name": "Claude: Text aufbereiten",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1980,
        300
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "createFromText",
        "content": "={{ $json.content.filter(c => c.type === 'text').map(c => c.text).join('\\n\\n') }}",
        "name": "={{ (() => { const v = $('Loop über Videos').item.json; const d = (v.published_at || '').slice(0, 10); return (d ? d + '-' : '') + v.title.replace(/[\\\\/]/g, '-').trim() + '-TS'; })() }}",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Konfiguration').first().json.drive_folder_id }}"
        },
        "options": {
          "convertToGoogleDocument": true
        }
      },
      "id": "5e2132a0-ddf3-4d9e-9a66-e4577b80e8d5",
      "name": "Google Drive: als Google Doc speichern",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        2200,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 900,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## YouTube-Transkripte → Google Docs\n1. **Konfiguration** öffnen: Kanal-URL und Google-Drive-Ordner-ID eintragen.\n2. Zugangsdaten (Credentials) zuweisen:\n   - Apify-Nodes: *Header Auth* → Name `Authorization`, Wert `Bearer DEIN_APIFY_TOKEN`\n   - Claude-Node: *Header Auth* → Name `x-api-key`, Wert `DEIN_ANTHROPIC_KEY`\n   - Google-Drive-Node: *Google Drive OAuth2*\n3. Erst mit `max_videos = 2` testen, dann auf 50 stellen.\n4. **Execute workflow** klicken."
      },
      "id": "fb07679a-36b4-4541-be88-7afa99475636",
      "name": "Anleitung",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -40
      ]
    }
